# v0.2 hands-on appliances (design/v0.2.md §B, sim::equipment): the hover label over a piece
# (what a click does now), the little float when a chore is done, the till's count, the cat by
# the bins, the free purge of a worn machine, the night-1 coach mark.
# Karolina is addressed in the second person (feminine forms in cs/uk/ru). Labels stay short.

